         /*****************************************************/
         /*  PGM NAME: CLOV400                                */
         /*                                                   */
         /*  CL PROGRAM USED TO ACCESS OFFICE VISION/400      */
         /*  DOCUMENTS BY EXECUTING WRKDOC COMMAND.  THE      */
         /*  PROGRAM WILL POINT TO THE SYSTEM DOCUMENTATION   */
         /*  FOLDER FOR THE UPCOMING RELEASE, AND BY          */
         /*  USING THE OFFICE VISION/400 EDITING FUNCTIONS,   */
         /*  PROVIDE COMPLETE DOCUMENT MAINTENANCE NEEDS.     */
         /*                                                   */
         /*  USED FROM GLOBAL MENU NAMED: ZDOC                */
         /*                                                   */
         /*****************************************************/

         WRKDOC   DOC(*ALL)  FLR(J0100FLR)
